[9.72924, "o", "    blocked: `git push --force origin main` rewrites the remote branch and can erase commits someone else pushed.\r\n    requires: Fetch, integrate the remote commits and push normally. On your own branch after a rebase, use `git push --force-with-lease=<branch>:<expected sha> --force-if-includes`.\r\n    does not count: the same effect through another git command, an alias, a script or a nested shell.\r\n"]
